{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "custom_conv_transpose1d",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, in_channels, length]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[out_channels]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "stride",
          "kind": "int",
          "default": 2,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding",
          "kind": "int",
          "default": 1,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "output_padding",
          "kind": "int",
          "default": 1,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, out_channels, output_length]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.conv_transpose(x)，使用 cuDNN 实现 1D 转置卷积。",
        "输入、权重、偏置均为 float32 CUDA tensor；输出形状由 ConvTranspose1d 公式 L_out = (L_in - 1)*stride - 2*padding + kernel_size + output_padding 计算。",
        "stride、padding、output_padding 为标量，应用于所有维度。",
        "权重形状为 [in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size]，偏置形状为 [out_channels]。",
        "输出为 contiguous 的 float32 CUDA tensor。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "custom_histc",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "任意形状，但必须连续",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bins",
          "kind": "int",
          "default": 100,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "min",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 0.0,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "max",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 100.0,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[bins]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 hist = torch.histc(x, bins=self.histc_bins, min=self.histc_min, max=self.histc_max)。",
        "计算输入张量元素的直方图，区间 [min, max] 均分为 bins 个 bin。",
        "返回值是长度为 bins 的 float32 CUDA tensor，每个元素表示落在该 bin 内的元素个数。",
        "边界行为与 torch.histc 一致：元素等于 max 时计入最后一个 bin，忽略 min 和 max 之外的 NaN/Inf。",
        "输入必须是 CUDA float32 tensor 且连续。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.conv_transpose(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对输入 x 应用 ConvTranspose1d，权重为 conv_transpose.weight，偏置为 conv_transpose.bias，stride=2, padding=1, output_padding=1。",
        "输出形状 [128, 16, 8192]，dtype float32，device cuda:0，contiguous。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "hist = torch.histc(x, bins=self.histc_bins, min=self.histc_min, max=self.histc_max)",
      "semantics": [
        "对上一步输出 x 计算直方图，bins=100, min=0, max=100。",
        "输出形状 [100]，dtype float32，device cuda:0，contiguous，元素为计数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return (x, hist)",
      "semantics": [
        "返回包含两个张量的元组：转置卷积结果 x 和直方图 hist，结构为 (tensor, tensor)。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}